{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-clickable-image-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To create clickable image in react js, you have to use  in  tag. It will create clickable image in react js. Today, I am…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To create clickable image in react js, you have to use <code class=\"language-text\">onClick</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;img></code> tag. It will create clickable image in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to create clickable image in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ClickableImage <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./ClickableImage'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> logo <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./beautiful-nature.jpeg'</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">onClick={handleClick}</code>  to create clickable image in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ClickableImage\n  src<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>logo<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  alt<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Clickable example\"</span>\n  onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Create clickable image example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">'./ClickableImage'</code> and use <code class=\"language-text\">onClick</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;img></code> tag to create clickable image in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ClickableImage <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./ClickableImage'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> logo <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./beautiful-nature.jpeg'</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">App</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">handleClick</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Image clicked!'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>ClickableImage\n      src<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>logo<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n      alt<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Clickable example\"</span>\n      onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">ClickableImage</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">ClickableImage</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> src<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> alt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> onClick <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>img\n    width<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token number\">400</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    height<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token number\">400</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    src<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>src<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    alt<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>alt<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    onClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>onClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    style<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token literal-property property\">cursor</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'pointer'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">// Ensures the pointer cursor is shown</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> ClickableImage<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">onClick</code> in <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;img></code> tag to create clickable image in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/b508b/clickable-image.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 59.49367088607595%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRm4AAABXRUJQVlA4IGIAAACwAwCdASoUAAwAPtFWo0uoJKMhsAgBABoJQBOj+ABW4piiinMfKAD7+3I7N1xnB5q7p8/P55Q9LakGOn9zEmnxuou7N6w5LTpZRk2cm2IdhJAWH+3JaW6IlDnoNM9TGoAAAA=='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, create, clickable, image\"\n        title=\"React, create, clickable, image\"\n        src=\"/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/8aab1/clickable-image.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/81b7c/clickable-image.webp 158w,\n/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/6ea66/clickable-image.webp 315w,\n/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/8aab1/clickable-image.webp 630w,\n/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/a70f5/clickable-image.webp 945w,\n/static/d158b62ce00a5d5d8c481f809ba08c97/b508b/clickable-image.webp 986w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to create clickable image in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"November 20, 2024","description":"Example of create clickable image in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to create breadcrumbs in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-21-how-to-create-breadcrumbs-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to create copyright symbol in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-copyright-symbol-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-clickable-image-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-11-21-how-to-create-breadcrumbs-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/2024-11-20-how-to-create-copyright-symbol-in-react-js/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2555585279","2714594843","3159585216"]}